    <string name="swivel_home_initial_guide_add_rearrange_sub_description_01">Bosh ekran dan yuqoriga turtish orqali o\'zingiz qo\'shadigan ilovalarni ko\'ring. Istalgan ilovani ilovalar tortmasida teging va bosib turing va uni %s ga qo\'shing.</string>
